msgid "Regi-TRUST is built on the open-source Trust mAnagement INfrastructure (TRAIN), developed by the Fraunhofer IAO as a part of the European Self-Sovereign Identity Framework (ESSIF) Lab. TRAIN uses/supports several established standards and is flexible with existing architectures, providing technical accessibility and inclusivity for implementors."
msgstr ""

